# Nothing binary is committed from this directory. Every image and trace here
# is regenerable from a one-line command (see README.md), the findings live as
# numbers in RESULTS.md, and git would keep these blobs forever without ever
# being able to diff them.

# Devtools traces — 60-160 MB each
trace-*.json

# Screenshots, annotated paint maps, and --shots bursts
*.png
shots-before/
shots-after/
